      "text": "Formalize CLI usage analysis as a repeatable workflow. Tools exist in .claude-research/tools/ (parse-ralph-logs.mjs, parse-claude-logs.mjs, compile-data.mjs) plus interactive HTML report. Consider: kspec skill, CLI command, or standalone workflow. Re-run after implementing the 6 CLI agent-UX improvements to measure impact.",
